        "name": "Escaping",
        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The term is URL-encoded with `urllib.parse.quote_plus` inside the href, and the whole URL is then HTML-escaped with `html.escape` (quote=True by default), while the visible label is escaped with `html.escape`, so neither `\"><script>x</script>` nor `a&b=c` can break out of the attribute, the query string or the text."
      },
